{"question_id": "T2-R11", "tier": 2, "question_type": "factual", "key_facts": [{"fact": "Mehrak is Kaveh's multi-function toolbox, not a 'compass spirit' — the question's framing contains a misconception.", "doc_source": "[NPC] Mehrak", "verified": true}, {"fact": "Kaveh built Mehrak from a modified machine core and some parts he had on hand.", "doc_source": "[NPC] Mehrak", "verified": true}, {"fact": "Kaveh built Mehrak because he wanted an automated case to transport his offloaded tools when he goes out.", "doc_source": "[NPC] Mehrak", "verified": true}, {"fact": "Mehrak's primary function is to assist Kaveh in his work as an architect, such as aiding him in mapping and surveying tasks.", "doc_source": "[NPC] Mehrak", "verified": true}, {"fact": "Mehrak also has other functions such as grabbing and projecting Kaveh's building designs.", "doc_source": "[NPC] Mehrak", "verified": true}, {"fact": "In Kaveh's playable unit, Mehrak is only alluded to in the final entry of Kaveh's Old Sketchbook, where the concept behind it is described (the document text is truncated at this point and full content is unavailable).", "doc_source": "[NPC] Mehrak", "verified": true}, {"fact": "Kaveh is the architect behind the Palace of Alcazarzaray and a graduate of the Kshahrewar Darshan, earning the moniker 'Light of Kshahrewar.'", "doc_source": "[PlayableCharacter] Kaveh", "verified": true}], "required_entities": ["Mehrak", "Kaveh", "Kshahrewar", "Palace of Alcazarzaray"], "required_relations": [{"head": "Kaveh", "relation": "created/built", "tail": "Mehrak", "doc_source": "[NPC] Mehrak"}, {"head": "Mehrak", "relation": "built_from", "tail": "modified machine core and spare parts", "doc_source": "[NPC] Mehrak"}, {"head": "Mehrak", "relation": "primary_function", "tail": "assisting Kaveh in architectural work (mapping, surveying, projecting designs)", "doc_source": "[NPC] Mehrak"}, {"head": "Kaveh", "relation": "profession", "tail": "architect (Light of Kshahrewar)", "doc_source": "[PlayableCharacter] Kaveh"}], "required_reasoning_steps": [], "hallucination_traps": [{"trap": "Calling Mehrak a 'compass spirit' or any kind of sentient spirit/creature.", "correct": "Mehrak is an automated multi-function toolbox/suitcase built by Kaveh from a modified machine core, not a spirit."}, {"trap": "Claiming Mehrak has defensive functions or can act autonomously without Kaveh's commands.", "correct": "Mehrak does not appear to have defensive functions, and it was not programmed to perform actions without Kaveh directly controlling or commanding it."}, {"trap": "Claiming Mehrak has deep emotional/sentimental origin (e.g., built from a memento of his father, inherited from a mentor, or a gift from Alhaitham).", "correct": "The documents only state Kaveh built it from a modified machine core and parts on hand for practical tool-transport purposes. The Old Sketchbook entry is truncated, so any further special significance is not confirmed in the provided text."}, {"trap": "Confusing Mehrak with a creature or familiar similar to other game companions (e.g., Oz for Fischl, Guoba for Xiangling).", "correct": "Mehrak is explicitly described as a green and white suitcase-shaped automated case with mechanical segments and green lights, a device not a creature."}, {"trap": "Claiming Mehrak is named after a specific person or has a stated naming origin in the documents.", "correct": "No information about the origin or meaning of Mehrak's name is provided in the reference documents."}, {"trap": "Confusing Mehrak's machine core with Scaramouche/Wanderer's mechanical origins or other Fatui/Akademiya technology.", "correct": "The documents only describe it as 'a modified machine core' without specifying its exact technological origin or any connection to other characters' technology."}], "min_acceptable_facts": 3, "coverage_notes": "缺：Mehrak名字的由来或含义——文档中完全没有提及。缺：Mehrak对Kaveh的'特殊意义'（special significance）——文档仅描述了实用功能和制造原因，Old Sketchbook条目在关键处被截断（'where the concept behind it'后