onship with the Sumeru Akademiya change before he joined the Forest Watchers?", "docs_fetched": {"layer_a": 3, "layer_b": 0, "layer_c": 0, "total": 3}, "tokens": {"oracle_in": 3525, "oracle_out": 816, "qc_in": 4702, "qc_out": 1265, "total": 10308}, "cost_usd": 0.2795}}
